From 645d75206b037636421820ecabbc011496de2c5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yurich <urvancevurij24@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:09:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: replace print with logging (#506)

Route the remaining diagnostic print() calls in front/src and back/src
through module loggers (logging.getLogger(__name__)) with a level that
matches the message: init_db/ensure_db_exists progress, DB selection,
missing SECRET_KEY_FILE, test user errors, VK registration DB error, pcap
dir creation and unknown node types in the backend topology.

Also drops the print of freshly issued JWT tokens in vk_callback (same
change as fix/506-stop-printing-jwt-tokens-front, so the branches merge
cleanly in any order).

Logging is already configured via logging.basicConfig(level=INFO) in
miminet_auth, which app.py imports before any of these run, so the
messages stay visible in 'python3 app.py' output and under uwsgi.
pcap_parser.py keeps its print(..., file=file): it writes a file, not a log.
---
 back/src/network_topology.py |  5 ++++-
 front/src/app.py             |  9 ++++++---
 front/src/miminet_auth.py    |  9 +++------
 front/src/miminet_config.py  |  5 ++++-
 front/src/miminet_model.py   | 29 +++++++++++++++++------------
 front/src/tasks.py           |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

